; The ledger's span is 2026-01-01 .. 2026-06-15, so January through May are
; complete months and June is a partial one. Every monthly figure this
; fixture is used to check depends on that distinction.

2026-01-01 * "Opening balance"
    Assets:Checking              3000.00 USD
    Equity:Opening-Balances

